SK: After I finished college, I moved to Boston because I took that job with Polaroid. [PAUSES] And during summers, when I was in high school, I had summer jobs. And sometimes in the summer, I would come and live in Boston. One of them, I worked at one of the hospitals in Boston during the summer. That was at the Peter Bent Brigham Hospital. It's no longer around. It was merged into Brigham and Women's, where my daughter works.

